- **The pair publishes together:** "a valid response makes its pair live and re-posts every k-scaled figure with the new k" and "an invalid response consumes the pending request, so the next valid one prices nothing", plus G1.
- **A warm request that read only part of its prefix:** the `savings-dollars.test.ts` row "a request that read part of its prefix from cache is priced warm".
- **The edges the design decides:** the `savings-dollars.test.ts` rows "a cache read whose token count is zero while its cost is not", "mixed short and one-hour cache writes, so the write rate is blended" and "a counterfactual that would have crossed a cost tier is priced at the actual read rate", and the test "a cost that is non-finite or negative falls back instead of pricing the request".

